  "releaseNotes": "## [4.9.0.0] - 2025-10-22\n\n### Added\n\n- A new notification when the initial device scan is complete. \n  When all devices that were connected when the SDK was started have been announced, the notification will be emitted.\n- Support for specifying the location of the Device Connector when initializing the SDK.\n  This allows for using the Device Connector from a non-standard location.\n- Support for running as part of a Maui application on macOS.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Improved device discovery time of the Jabra PanaCast 20.\n- More robust discovery of devices that may respond slowly to initial requests.\n- An issue with discovery of dongle connected devices. Sometimes the dongle would announce the device before it was ready to respond to requests.\n- Several issues with running the SDK on macOS.",
